<<
/A <<
/S /URI /Type /Action /URI (Notes:%20Alocasia%20sinuata%20is%20botanically%20poorly%20known,%20though%20it%20has%20been%20in%20cultivation%20for%20over%20a%20century.%20Two%20forms%20exist%20in%20cultivation%20today%20under%20the%20names%20Alocasia%20Quilted%20Dreams%20and%20Alocasia%20Bullata%20\(the%20latter%20used%20as%20a%20pseudobinomial%20but%20it%20is%20botanically%20invalid\).%20I%20have%20seen%20only%20one%20collection%20from%20the%20wild,%20unfortunately%20without%20habitat%20notes.%20The%20type%20was%20at%20first%20said%20to%20have%20originated%20in%20the%20'Malay%20Archipelago'%20\(N.E.%20Brown,%20loc.%20cit.\).%20However,%20the%20label%20has%20subsequently%20been%20altered%20in%20Brown's%20hand%20to%20indicate%20that%20the%20plant%20originated%20in%20the%20Philippines.%20Observations%20on%20the%20species'%20alleged%20large%20size%20made%20by%20W.%20Bull%20which%20Brown%20\(loc.%20cit.\)%20quoted%20\(%20k%20a%20full%20grown%20plant%20would%20be%20about%204%20or%205%20feet%20in%20diameter'\),%20notwithstanding%20the%20much%20smaller%20dimensions%20of%20the%20type%20plant%20and%20matching%20material,%20are%20evidently%20incorrect%20\(other%20material%20examined%20is%20somewhat%20smaller%20than%20the%20type\).%20The%20collection%20cited%20below%20originating%20in%20Palawan%20is%20included%20with%20some%20doubt%20as%20the%20sterile%20interstice%20is%20much%20attenuated%20and%20the%20secondary%20venation%20seems%20not%20to%20form%20subsidiary%20veins.%20In%20other%20respects,%20however,%20the%20specimen%20matches%20A.%20sinuata.%20Other%20specimens%20seen:%20Cult.%20University%20of%20Florida%20Agricultural%20Research%20Station%20ex%20Leyte%20Island,%20Croat%2056900%20\(MO\);%20Cult.%20Missouri%20Botanical%20Garden%20ex%20cult.%20Manila%20Memorial%20Park,%20Croat%2057106%20\(MO\);%20Cult.%20Missouri%20Botanical%20Garden%20ex%20Palawan,%20Croat%2057188%20\(MO\);%20Mindanao,%20Surigao%20Prov.,%20without%20specific%20locality,%20Ramos%20&%20Pascasio%20BS%2034353%20\(K,%20US\).)
>> /Border [ 0 0 0 ] /Rect [ 70.8 709.3875 285.441 723.3875 ] /Subtype /Link /Type /Annot
>>
